lass=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"0fbfc19800246e77\" href=\"?note=0fbfc19800246e77\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-regular-cardinal.md\">../batch13/58-df-regular-cardinal.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Form}_\\in\">\\(\\operatorname{Form}_\\in\\)</span> (membership-language formula codes, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"65418b505fc53093\" href=\"?note=65418b505fc53093\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-formula.md\">../batch17/58-df-formula.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\models_{\\mathrm{meta}}\">\\(\\models_{\\mathrm{meta}}\\)</span> is the metatheoretic satisfaction relation for the set structures <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(V_\\xi,\\in\\cap(V_\\xi\\times V_\\xi))\">\\((V_\\xi,\\in\\cap(V_\\xi\\times V_\\xi))\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcLargecard4ReflectingCardinal}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcLargecard4ReflectingCardinal}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}largecard4\\text{-}reflecting\\text{-}cardinal} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcLargecard4ReflectingCardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\omega&lt;\\kappa\\land\\forall\\varphi\\in\\operatorname{Form}_\\in\\;\\forall\\bar a\\in V_\\kappa^{&lt;\\omega}\\;\\left((V_\\kappa,\\in\\cap(V_\\kappa\\times V_\\kappa))\\models_{\\mathrm{meta}}\\varphi[\\bar a]\\to\\exists\\alpha&lt;\\kappa\\;(\\bar a\\in V_\\alpha^{&lt;\\omega}\\land(V_\\alpha,\\in\\cap(V_\\alpha\\times V_\\alpha))\\models_{\\mathrm{meta}}\\varphi[\\bar a])\\right)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}largecard4\\text{-}reflecting\\text{-}cardinal} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcLargecard4ReflectingCardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\omega&lt;\\kappa\\land\\forall\\varphi\\in\\operatorname{Form}_\\in\\;\\forall\\bar a\\in V_\\kappa^{&lt;\\omega}\\;\\left((V_\\kappa,\\in\\cap(V_\\kappa\\times V_\\kappa))\\models_{\\mathrm{meta}}\\varphi[\\bar a]\\to\\exists\\alpha&lt;\\kappa\\;(\\bar a\\in V_\\alpha^{&lt;\\omega}\\land(V_\\alpha,\\in\\cap(V_\\alpha\\times V_\\alpha))\\models_{\\mathrm{meta}}\\varphi[\\bar a])\\right)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Formula parameters are finite tuples, not a single undeclared parameter. Satisfaction is explicitly metatheoretic and the membership relations on both rank levels are displayed.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch13/58-df-regular-cardinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"0fbfc19800246e77","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch13/58-df-regular-cardinal.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-formula.md","status":"resolved","id":"65418b505fc53093","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-df-formula.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch13/58-df-regular-cardinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"0fbfc19800246e77","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S(\\kappa)$ and $\\omega<\\kappa$ (see [[../batch13/58-df-regular-cardinal.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-formula.md","status":"resolved","id":"65418b505fc53093","anchor":"ref-5","target